{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"329f916010187406f161061477ccaa609a7cfa22231e8b51f90b321f35ab1028\",\n  \"coverage\": [\n    \"Read native schematic, PCB, project settings, requirements and supplied check records.\",\n    \"Fresh native netlist export confirms /IN: J1.1–R1.1; /OUT: R1.2–C1.1–J1.2; GND: C1.2–J1.3.\",\n    \"Independently enumerated all five saved track segments: each is 0.25 mm, satisfying the 0.20 mm requirement. See review-work/physical/experiments/native-audit.json, track_width_check.\",\n    \"Inspected placement, closed 20 × 12 mm outline, OUT branch junction, capacitor ground trace, via and saved bottom-plane thermal connections. A sampled ground-copper route connects J1.3 to the via. See review-work/physical/experiments/native-audit.json, ground_fill.\",\n    \"Reran KiCad DRC with schematic parity; report arrays contain zero violations, unconnected items and parity issues. See review-work/physical/experiments/independent-drc.json.\",\n    \"Independently calculated the RC response and checked the supplied stimulus and measurements. Commands, versions, assumptions and outcomes are recorded in review-work/physical/experiments/README.md and commands.json.\"\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"assessment\": \"defect\",\n      \"condition\": \"Apply the required ideal 1 V step at /IN with no external load and an initially discharged capacitor.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Requirement 1: V(/OUT) at 1 ms must be between 0.62 V and 0.65 V\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/requirements/fixture-requirements.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Line 1274: R1 Value=\\\"100k\\\"; line 955: C1 Value=\\\"100n\\\"\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_sch\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Line 256: R1 Value=\\\"100k\\\"; line 107: C1 Value=\\\"100n\\\"; R1/C1 pad net assignments\",\n          \"path\": \"inputs/project/rc_filter.kicad_pcb\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"rc_calculation: tau_s=0.01; vout_1ms_V=0.09516258196404043\",\n          \"path\": \"review-work/physical/experiments/native-audit.json\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"R1 IN OUT 100k; C1 OUT 0 100n; VSTEP PWL(0 0 1n 1)\",\n          \"path\": \"work/rc-step/deck.cir\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"locator\": \"Measurements for Transient Analysis: vout_1ms=9.516251e-02\",\n          \"path\": \"work/rc-step/ngspice.log\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"id\": \"physical-001\",\n      \"location\": \"R1 value in the native schematic and PCB\",\n      \"mechanism\": \"R1=100 kΩ and C1=100 nF produce RC=10 ms. The unloaded response Vout(t)=1−exp(−t/RC) therefore reaches only approximately 0.09516 V at 1 ms.\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"The direct native values and independently confirmed connectivity predict a voltage below the required 0.62 V minimum. The recorded simulation agrees with the calculation. Its 1 ns input rise cannot explain this large discrepancy. Clean ERC and DRC results do not establish compliance with the response requirement.\",\n      \"severity\": \"major\",\n      \"title\": \"Saved R1 value causes the required 1 ms step response to fail\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Zone fill was inspected as saved; no refill was performed. Sampled copper continuity does not establish resistance or impedance.\",\n    \"No hardware measurements, parasitic extraction, tolerance, temperature, loading, ADC sampling or EMI evaluation.\",\n    \"No ampacity or thermal qualification; track width alone was not treated as evidence of either.\",\n    \"No supplier part-rating verification, fabrication capability approval, production Gerber/drill audit, assembly testing or mechanical mating/enclosure evaluation.\",\n    \"Ignored ERC/DRC rule classes were recorded but not exhaustively independently verified. The DRC rerun shares the supplied check's KiCad engine.\",\n    \"The 5 ms response measurement has no declared acceptance bound.\"\n  ],\n  \"packet_sha256\": \"872337c4728304014ef3dc9571ce3b45f351644ba75d47e1a65d53401a913198\",\n  \"role\": \"physical\",\n  \"run_id\": \"d49a7f53-6b11-4774-86dd-8799a02e97fd\",\n  \"schema\": \"agent-ee.review/1\"\n}"}}
